<title>USA: Stewart settles FTC claim on Dallas units.</title>
<headline>Stewart settles FTC claim on Dallas units.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stewart Enterprises Inc said Thursday it has settled a Federal Trade Commission complaint against five of its funeral homes in Dallas, agreeing to pay about $30,000 for each home.</p>
<p>The company said the settlement &quot;acknowledges no violations&quot; and that it is a &quot;substantially less&quot; amount than it would have otherwise cost to pursue the matter in court.</p>
<p>Stewart Enterprises operates 211 funeral homes and 114 cemeteries in 21 states, Australia, New Zealand, Mexico and Puerto Rico.</p>
